LINK_NAME Details
LINK ../station_maintenance/station_maintenance.html#sta_display

DESCRIPTION <b>sta_display</b> is one of a collection of tools developed
to manage station metadata in an Earthworm database.  <b>sta_display</b>
retrieves a specified subset of station metadata from an Earthworm database,
and writes it to a flat file.
Please see the details page for more information.
